00:32:13.698 --> 00:32:17.268
SLAVERY, QUOTE UNQUOTE,

00:32:17.335 --> 00:32:19.871
OFFICIALLY ENDED IN 1863 WHEN

00:32:19.937 --> 00:32:23.374
PRESIDENT LINCOLN SIGNED THE

00:32:23.441 --> 00:32:24.142
EMANCIPATION PROCLAMATION,

00:32:24.208 --> 00:32:28.713
TECHNICALLY, FOR MANY, IT DIDN'T

00:32:28.780 --> 00:32:29.947
END UNTIL TWO AND A HALF YEARS

00:32:30.014 --> 00:32:32.050
LATER, WHEN SOME FREED SLAVES

00:32:32.116 --> 00:32:35.520
GOT THE WORD. BUT TRUTH BE TOLD,

00:32:35.586 --> 00:32:36.621
SLAVERY DID NOT END IN THIS

00:32:36.688 --> 00:32:42.460
STATE UNTIL THE AMENDMENT OF THE

00:32:42.527 --> 00:32:43.561
13TH AMENDMENT, BECAUSE WHAT THE

00:32:43.628 --> 00:32:46.164
EMANCIPATION PROCLAMATION DID

00:32:46.230 --> 00:32:49.133
WAS ONLY FREED THOSE SLAVES THAT

00:32:49.200 --> 00:32:50.168
WERE IN CONFEDERATE STATES. SO

00:32:50.234 --> 00:32:53.538
IF YOU WERE PART OF THE UNION

00:32:53.604 --> 00:32:54.739
AND YOU STILL HAD SLAVES, YOU

00:32:54.806 --> 00:32:56.741
YOU CONTROLLED YOUR SLAVES UNTIL

00:32:56.808 --> 00:32:58.576
THE AMENDMENT, THE 13TH

00:32:58.643 --> 00:33:01.713
AMENDMENT WAS AMENDED. SO

00:33:01.779 --> 00:33:05.483
JUNETEENTH NOW COMMEMORATES THAT

00:33:05.550 --> 00:33:06.751
TWO AND A HALF YEAR DELAY FOR

00:33:06.818 --> 00:33:08.920
SOLDIERS TO REACH GALVESTON,

00:33:08.986 --> 00:33:12.490
TEXAS. AND IT'S MUCH DEBATE OVER

00:33:12.557 --> 00:33:16.027
WHY JUNETEENTH VERSUS JUNE 19TH,

00:33:16.094 --> 00:33:19.230
SPECIFICALLY JUNE 19TH, IS WHEN,

00:33:19.297 --> 00:33:20.331
THE A MAJOR GENERAL GRANGER

00:33:20.398 --> 00:33:22.934
REACHED GALVESTON, BUT THE WORD

00:33:23.000 --> 00:33:26.204
STARTED PROGRESSING WESTERLY,

00:33:26.270 --> 00:33:27.171
FROM LOUISIANA TO TEXAS,

00:33:27.238 --> 00:33:29.741
SOMEWHERE BETWEEN THE 12TH AND

00:33:29.807 --> 00:33:31.509
THE 19TH. SO THAT'S WHY

00:33:31.576 --> 00:33:33.444
DIFFERENT INDIVIDUALS GOT THE

00:33:33.511 --> 00:33:35.179
WORD AT DIFFERENT TIMES. BUT IT

00:33:35.246 --> 00:33:35.747
FINALLY ENDED ON JUNE 19TH,

00:33:35.813 --> 00:33:39.016
WHERE OVER 250 SLAVES IN TEXAS

00:33:39.083 --> 00:33:41.586
WERE NOTIFIED THAT THEY WERE

00:33:41.652 --> 00:33:42.754
FREE. AND ALTHOUGH JUNETEENTH

00:33:42.820 --> 00:33:44.822
HAS ONLY BEEN A NATIONAL HOLIDAY

00:33:44.889 --> 00:33:48.459
SINCE THE 21ST, 2021, I SHOULD

00:33:48.526 --> 00:33:51.763
SAY AMERICANS HAVE LONG

00:33:51.829 --> 00:33:52.764
CELEBRATED THIS HOLIDAY. THIS

00:33:52.830 --> 00:33:56.567
WAS A HOUSEHOLD EVENT FOR ME AND

00:33:56.634 --> 00:33:59.971
MY FAMILY. AND MY FAMILY'S FROM

00:34:00.037 --> 00:34:02.640
TEXAS. AND UP UNTIL MY FATHER

00:34:02.707 --> 00:34:03.841
PASSED, HE WENT BACK TO TEXAS TO

00:34:03.908 --> 00:34:05.943
CELEBRATE JUNETEENTH EVERY YEAR.

00:34:06.010 --> 00:34:09.280
AND IT'S OFTEN ASSOCIATED WITH

00:34:09.347 --> 00:34:12.316
JUNETEENTH WATERMELON RED

00:34:12.383 --> 00:34:15.653
HIBISCUS TEA, OR AS MY GREAT

00:34:15.720 --> 00:34:16.687
GRANDMOTHER USED TO SAY, RED

00:34:16.754 --> 00:34:19.157
SODA POP OR SODA WATER AND RED

00:34:19.223 --> 00:34:22.827
VELVET CAKE. AND THE

00:34:22.894 --> 00:34:23.961
SIGNIFICANCE OF THAT WAS BECAUSE

00:34:24.028 --> 00:34:27.465
OF THE BLOOD THAT WE SHED FOR

00:34:27.532 --> 00:34:30.034
THIS NATION, AND THAT SYMBOLIZED

00:34:30.101 --> 00:34:31.169
THAT BLOOD. AND THAT DAY WAS

00:34:31.235 --> 00:34:33.805
ALWAYS COLORFUL WITH MUSIC, WITH

00:34:33.871 --> 00:34:37.341
ALL KIND OF FOOD AND FESTIVITIES

00:34:37.408 --> 00:34:38.543
. AND THAT'S WHY I HAVE RED ON

00:34:38.609 --> 00:34:41.078
THE DAY TO AGAIN CELEBRATE THOSE

00:34:41.145 --> 00:34:44.348
COLORS AND THOSE SYMBOLISMS OF

00:34:44.415 --> 00:34:48.553
JUNETEENTH AND WHAT IT MEANS.

00:34:48.619 --> 00:34:49.654
AND IT'S VITALLY IMPORTANT THAT

00:34:49.720 --> 00:34:51.355
WE UNDERSTAND, ESPECIALLY IN

00:34:51.422 --> 00:34:54.792
LIGHT OF REPARATIONS. JUNETEENTH

00:34:54.859 --> 00:34:58.129
IS AN INHERENTLY REMINDER OF THE

00:34:58.196 --> 00:34:59.263
NATION'S DARK PAST. THE UNITED

00:34:59.330 --> 00:35:01.532
STATES IS A GREAT COUNTRY, BUT

00:35:01.599 --> 00:35:04.502
IT'S A GREAT COUNTRY IN LARGE

00:35:04.569 --> 00:35:05.670
PART BECAUSE IT WAS BUILT AND

00:35:05.736 --> 00:35:08.573
MADE PROSPEROUS FOR OVER 250

00:35:08.639 --> 00:35:12.076
YEARS OF SLAVE LABOR BY BLACK

00:35:12.143 --> 00:35:14.011
FOLKS WHO LOOK LIKE ME. AND EVEN

00:35:14.078 --> 00:35:15.613
THOUGH SLAVERY HAS ENDED ITS

00:35:15.680 --> 00:35:18.649
IMPACTS, IMPACTS STILL EXISTS IN

00:35:18.716 --> 00:35:19.884
OUR COUNTRY AND OUR STATE TODAY.

00:35:19.951 --> 00:35:23.020
THAT'S NOT JUST MY CLAIM, IT'S

00:35:23.087 --> 00:35:24.121
THE BELIEF OF MAJORITY OF

00:35:24.188 --> 00:35:26.424
CALIFORNIANS WITH OVER 60% WHO

00:35:26.491 --> 00:35:29.060
REGISTERED TO VOTE STATED SO IN

00:35:29.126 --> 00:35:31.629
A POLL. BERKELEY CONDUCTED A

00:35:31.696 --> 00:35:34.799
