TODAY? AND 60% STILL SELL. IT

00:35:38.336 --> 00:35:41.205
WAS FELT. IT WAS, FELT TODAY 158

00:35:41.272 --> 00:35:42.306
YEARS LATER. AND BOTH HEALTH

00:35:42.373 --> 00:35:44.842
DISPARITIES, WEALTH DISPARITIES,

00:35:44.909 --> 00:35:45.543
EDUCATION DISPARITIES, MASS

00:35:45.610 --> 00:35:48.279
INCARCERATION, THÀNH HOUSING

