00:35:55.019 --> 00:35:55.920
RACIALLY MOTIVATED TAKING BY

00:35:55.987 --> 00:35:58.489
EMINENT DOMAIN, HAVE HARMED AND

00:35:58.556 --> 00:35:59.557
HELD BLACK AMERICANS FROM

00:35:59.624 --> 00:36:01.859
REALIZING THE AMERICAN DREAM

00:36:01.926 --> 00:36:04.128
FREELY AND FULLY FOR OVER 200

00:36:04.195 --> 00:36:07.231
YEARS. SO JUNETEENTH IS A TIME

00:36:07.298 --> 00:36:08.332
