00:36:13.704 --> 00:36:14.672
CONTRIBUTIONS THAT HAVE BEEN

00:36:14.739 --> 00:36:17.041
MADE, THE CELEBRATIONS AND THE

00:36:17.108 --> 00:36:18.109
LOSSES AND RECOGNIZE RECOGNIZE

