01:01:12.869 --> 01:01:15.338
LEADER AND CIVIL RIGHTS ACTIVIST

01:01:15.405 --> 01:01:17.640
, VICTOR GARZA, WHO PASSED AWAY

01:01:17.707 --> 01:01:20.843
ON JUNE 6TH AT THE AGE OF 86.

01:01:20.910 --> 01:01:22.011
VICTOR WAS AN ADVOCATE AT HEART,

01:01:22.078 --> 01:01:24.447
AND HIS UNWAVERING COMMITMENT TO

01:01:24.514 --> 01:01:25.681
THE FIGHT FOR CIVIL RIGHTS CAN

01:01:25.748 --> 01:01:28.751
BE SEEN TO THIS DAY. AND

01:01:28.818 --> 01:01:29.886
EVERYTHING HE'S DONE AS A YOUNG

01:01:29.952 --> 01:01:32.422
MAN, HE SERVED AS A WELDER IN

01:01:32.488 --> 01:01:34.557
THE UNITED STATES NAVY. HE LATER

01:01:34.624 --> 01:01:36.459
WENT ON TO BECOME A MANAGER FOR

01:01:36.526 --> 01:01:38.094
THE SANTA CLARA COUNTY VETERANS

01:01:38.161 --> 01:01:38.961
SERVICES OFFICES, WHERE HE

01:01:39.028 --> 01:01:41.364
RECEIVED SEVERAL AWARDS FOR HIS

01:01:41.431 --> 01:01:45.234
ADVOCACY FOR VETERANS. IN 1988,

01:01:45.301 --> 01:01:48.337
VICTOR FOUNDED LA RAZA ROUND

01:01:48.404 --> 01:01:49.572
TABLE TO GIVE LATINO AND MEXICAN

01:01:49.639 --> 01:01:51.607
AMERICANS A VOICE IN CREATING

01:01:51.674 --> 01:01:52.608
POSITIVE CHANGE ALONGSIDE

01:01:52.675 --> 01:01:54.877
COMMUNITY LEADERS AND POLICY

01:01:54.944 --> 01:01:58.114
MAKERS. AT ABOUT THAT TIME, HE

01:01:58.181 --> 01:01:59.248
BECAME A LONGTIME BOARD MEMBER

01:01:59.315 --> 01:02:01.217
AND LEADER AT THE CENTER FOR

01:02:01.284 --> 01:02:04.520
TRAINING AND CAREERS IN SAN JOSE

01:02:04.587 --> 01:02:05.755
. HE SPENT HIS LIFE FIGHTING FOR

01:02:05.822 --> 01:02:06.589
EQUITABLE EMPLOYMENT AND

01:02:06.656 --> 01:02:08.724
EDUCATION THÀNH ESPECIALLY FOR

01:02:08.791 --> 01:02:11.661
LATINOS. HE FOUNDED MENTORSHIP

01:02:11.727 --> 01:02:12.829
PROGRAMS TO HELP LATINO STUDENTS

01:02:12.895 --> 01:02:15.531
STRUGGLING IN MATH AND ENGLISH.

01:02:15.598 --> 01:02:16.699
AS THE FIRST LATINO ELECTED TO

01:02:16.766 --> 01:02:17.800
THE BOARD OF THE BERRYESSA

01:02:17.867 --> 01:02:18.801
SCHOOL DISTRICT, HE WAS

01:02:18.868 --> 01:02:19.635
INSTRUMENTAL IN THE

01:02:19.702 --> 01:02:22.338
SUPERINTENDENT HIRING LATINO

01:02:22.405 --> 01:02:23.172
PRINCIPALS, ADMINISTRATORS, AND

01:02:23.239 --> 01:02:25.741
TEACHERS. VICTOR'S ADVOCACY

01:02:25.808 --> 01:02:28.978
RESULTED IN NATIONWIDE ACCLAIM,

01:02:29.045 --> 01:02:31.714
INCLUDING INVITATIONS FROM THE

01:02:31.781 --> 01:02:32.682
CLINTON ADMINISTRATION TO

01:02:32.748 --> 01:02:33.749
PARTICIPATE IN AN INITIATIVE ON

01:02:33.816 --> 01:02:36.085
RACE AND POVERTY AS PART OF A

01:02:36.152 --> 01:02:38.421
CONTINGENT OF LATINO LEADERS

01:02:38.488 --> 01:02:39.422
VISITED BY THE OBAMA

01:02:39.489 --> 01:02:41.824
ADMINISTRATION. LATER ON, I WAS

01:02:41.891 --> 01:02:45.728
SURPRISED, EVEN HAVING KNOWN HIM

01:02:45.795 --> 01:02:48.264
FOR A COUPLE OF DECADES WHEN I

01:02:48.331 --> 01:02:51.134
STARTED TO REALIZE HIS NATIONAL

01:02:51.200 --> 01:02:51.667
REACH AND REPRESENTATION,

01:02:51.734 --> 01:02:54.604
ESPECIALLY WHEN HE STARTED TO

01:02:54.670 --> 01:02:56.506
INVITE ME ON OUT OF STATE TRIPS

01:02:56.572 --> 01:02:58.341
WITH HIM TO VISIT PROGRAMS,

01:02:58.407 --> 01:03:01.210
ESPECIALLY PROGRAMS THAT WERE

01:03:01.277 --> 01:03:02.178
INTENDED TO REDUCE POPULATIONS

01:03:02.245 --> 01:03:04.714
IN JUVENILE HALLS AND CREATE

01:03:04.780 --> 01:03:07.617
OPPORTUNITIES FOR STUDENTS IN

01:03:07.683 --> 01:03:08.718
PLACES LIKE ARIZONA AND OTHER

01:03:08.784 --> 01:03:11.387
PLACES IN THE COUNTRY. HIS

01:03:11.454 --> 01:03:12.421
PASSION AND VISION FOR OUR

01:03:12.488 --> 01:03:14.790
COMMUNITY HAS LEFT A MARK ON ALL

01:03:14.857 --> 01:03:17.927
OF CALIFORNIA. AND AS I SAID IN

01:03:17.994 --> 01:03:19.061
OTHER STATES ACROSS THE UNION,

01:03:19.128 --> 01:03:21.330
HE WILL CONTINUE TO GUIDE US FOR

01:03:21.397 --> 01:03:23.232
YEARS TO COME. AND WE LOST A

01:03:23.299 --> 01:03:25.668
REAL GIANT. BUT HIS LEGACY WILL

01:03:25.735 --> 01:03:28.104
LIVE ON THE WORK WE DO TO CREATE

01:03:28.171 --> 01:03:31.674
A FAIRER, MORE JUST SOCIETY. NOT

01:03:31.741 --> 01:03:32.942
JUST IN SAN JOSE OR SANTA CLARA

01:03:33.009 --> 01:03:34.944
COUNTY, BUT AS I SAID, ACROSS

01:03:35.011 --> 01:03:37.180
CALIFORNIA AND IN SEVERAL OTHER

01:03:37.246 --> 01:03:41.017
STATES AS WELL. VICTOR COULD

01:03:41.083 --> 01:03:47.223
CONVENE ANYBODY AT ANY TIME, NOT

01:03:47.290 --> 01:03:48.491
IN THE SENSE OF BEING A CLASSIC

01:03:48.558 --> 01:03:54.530
MEDIATOR OR SOMEBODY WHO USED

01:03:54.597 --> 01:03:59.135
SUGAR INSTEAD OF SOME KIND OF A

01:03:59.202 --> 01:04:02.038
STICK. HE DEMANDED THAT PEOPLE

01:04:02.104 --> 01:04:06.275
CONVENE. THAT'S WHAT HE DID. AND

01:04:06.342 --> 01:04:08.711
THEY DID. IT DIDN'T MATTER IF

01:04:08.778 --> 01:04:11.781
THE INDIVIDUAL WAS A MAYOR OR A

01:04:11.847 --> 01:04:15.151
POLICE CHIEF OR SOMEBODY WHO

01:04:15.218 --> 01:04:16.285
NEEDED TO FLY IN FROM LOS

01:04:16.352 --> 01:04:19.722
ANGELES INTO THE BAY AREA. FOR

01:04:19.789 --> 01:04:22.058
EXAMPLE, WHEN VICTOR SAID, WE'RE

01:04:22.124 --> 01:04:25.595
PUTTING A GROUP TOGETHER TO

01:04:25.661 --> 01:04:26.596
BRING JUSTICE, EVERYBODY SHOWED

01:04:26.662 --> 01:04:29.799
UP. HE SURVIVED BY HIS FIVE

01:04:29.865 --> 01:04:32.101
CHILDREN, SEVERAL GRANDCHILDREN

01:04:32.168 --> 01:04:35.238
AND HIS SIBLINGS. MR. PRESIDENT,

01:04:35.304 --> 01:04:36.339
A THANK YOU TODAY FOR THE

01:04:36.405 --> 01:04:39.475
