01:05:38.234 --> 01:05:41.504
WOULD NEVER STOP AFTER THAT. SHE

01:05:41.570 --> 01:05:42.505
MET HER HUSBAND, RICHARD

01:05:42.571 --> 01:05:45.007
SCHRENK, IN 1972, WHEN SHE

01:05:45.074 --> 01:05:46.175
