01:05:46.242 --> 01:05:47.543
DURING THE GEORGE MCGOVERN

01:05:47.610 --> 01:05:50.680
CAMPAIGN. MARTY, AS I SAID, WAS

01:05:50.746 --> 01:05:52.481
THE BACKBONE OF THE PARTY. SHE

01:05:52.548 --> 01:05:55.217
