01:06:03.192 --> 01:06:04.760
PRESIDENT OF DEMOCRATS OF NORTH

01:06:04.827 --> 01:06:05.795
ORANGE COUNTY, VOLUNTEER

01:06:05.861 --> 01:06:06.696
COORDINATOR FOR DEMOCRATIC PARTY

01:06:06.762 --> 01:06:08.864
