01:06:16.005 --> 01:06:18.708
VIRTUALLY EVERY YOUNG DEMOCRAT,

01:06:18.774 --> 01:06:19.642
EVERY ASPIRING DEMOCRAT, EVERY

01:06:19.709 --> 01:06:24.447
