01:06:27.917 --> 01:06:28.951
ME, AS A TESTAMENT TO HER

01:06:29.018 --> 01:06:31.187
DECADES OF MENTORSHIP, SHE WOULD

01:06:31.253 --> 01:06:35.324
MEANT SHE WOULD SHE WOULD REACH

01:06:35.391 --> 01:06:36.425
OUT TO YOUNG MEMBERS AND

01:06:36.492 --> 01:06:37.393
IDENTIFY THEM FOR FUTURE

01:06:37.460 --> 01:06:40.529
LEADERSHIP POSITIONS. SHE WAS

01:06:40.596 --> 01:06:41.664
ALSO INVOLVED WITH THE UNITED

01:06:41.731 --> 01:06:42.665
FARM WORKERS AND MARCHED

01:06:42.732 --> 01:06:43.966
ALONGSIDE HER FRIENDS AND

01:06:44.033 --> 01:06:45.701
