01:06:45.768 --> 01:06:48.571
HUERTA, SOME OF YOU MAY BE OLD

01:06:48.637 --> 01:06:51.273
ENOUGH TO REMEMBER THE 1996

01:06:51.340 --> 01:06:52.341
CAMPAIGN BETWEEN LORETTA SANCHEZ

01:06:52.408 --> 01:06:54.744
AND BOB DORNAN, AND SHE WAS

01:06:54.810 --> 01:06:57.980
QUITE MEMORABLE. YOU CAN GOOGLE

01:06:58.047 --> 01:07:01.217
THIS, FOR SERENADING BOB DORNAN

01:07:01.283 --> 01:07:04.320
