01:07:30.980 --> 01:07:34.250
SACRAMENTO, HER STEPSON JIM, HER

01:07:34.316 --> 01:07:35.251
STEPDAUGHTER RENEE, HER BROTHER

01:07:35.317 --> 01:07:37.787
PAUL, AND SISTER, DEBBIE HAFNER,

01:07:37.853 --> 01:07:38.754
